# Normalize line endings to LF for all text files, regardless of the
# checkout platform's git config (e.g. core.autocrlf=true, which is the
# default on GitHub-hosted windows-latest runners). Without this, text
# files -- including hash-pinned reference data such as
# src/services/cghs/data/hfos-reference-rates.json -- are checked out
# with CRLF on Windows, changing their SHA-256 and breaking the
# byte-identical snapshot gates enforced by the Windows release build
# and its test suite.
* text=auto eol=lf
